.TH ELEPHANTWALK 1
.SH NAME
elephantwalk \- animated elephant
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/elephantwalk
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I ElephantWalk
is a animated elephant.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Move an elephant around the panel with wasd or the arrows.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B arrows / wasd
Move elephant
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/elephantwalk.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR wm (1)
